---
source: crates/nash-ast/src/head.rs
description: "Impls in declaration order and how each one matches the arguments. Inference uses SelectPolicy::Defer; entailment and evidence use SelectPolicy::Exact."
---
no impls
  inference: no impl
  entailment and evidence: no impl
does not match, does not match
  inference: no impl
  entailment and evidence: no impl
does not match, matches, does not match
  inference: selects impl 2
  entailment and evidence: selects impl 2
matches, undecided
  inference: waits
  entailment and evidence: selects impl 1
undecided, matches
  inference: waits
  entailment and evidence: selects impl 2
undecided, does not match
  inference: waits
  entailment and evidence: undecided
does not match, matches (fuel for one step)
  inference: out of fuel
  entailment and evidence: out of fuel
